INT. CHEESE CAVE - DAY

Damp stone. Wheels of cheese on wooden racks stretch into the dark. A single bare bulb.

BARNABY QUILL, 40s, in a hairnet and white coat, taps a wheel with a wooden mallet and listens. Behind him stands INGRID SOLBERG, 30s, an inspector in a lanyard, with a clipboard and a thermometer.

INGRID
Mr. Quill. Your humidity's at ninety-four percent.

BARNABY
That's the idea.

INGRID
The code says ninety.

BARNABY
The cheese says ninety-four.

INGRID
The cheese doesn't write the code.

BARNABY
The cheese is older than the code.

She checks her clipboard. He taps another wheel.

INGRID
There's mold on the north wall.

BARNABY
That's a feature.

INGRID
It's black.

BARNABY
That's a deluxe feature.

INGRID
It's growing on the cheese.

BARNABY
That's the cheese.

INGRID
(flat)
Mr. Quill.

BARNABY
Ms. Solberg.

She thrusts the thermometer into the nearest wheel. A long beat. She pulls it out and reads it.

INGRID
Fifty-four degrees.

BARNABY
Perfect.

INGRID
It should be fifty.

BARNABY
Perfect plus four.

INGRID
I'm writing you up.

BARNABY
You're writing me up for being warm?

INGRID
For several things.

BARNABY
Name three.

INGRID
Humidity. Temperature. Mold.

BARNABY
Name a fourth.

INGRID
(pausing, scanning the room)
Smell.

BARNABY
(delighted)
Now you're getting it.

INGRID
It's not a compliment.

BARNABY
(simultaneously)
It's not a crime.

^INGRID
(simultaneously)
It's not a compliment.

They stare at each other. The bulb flickers. A drop of water lands on her clipboard.

BARNABY
Ms. Solberg, would you like to taste?

INGRID
No.

BARNABY
Just a sliver.

INGRID
I am an inspector. I cannot be bribed.

BARNABY
It's not a bribe. It's an appetizer.

She hesitates. He cuts a thin wedge with a wire, offers it on the blade. She takes it between two fingers, sniffs, and chews once. Her eyes close.

INGRID
(muffled)
Oh, no.

BARNABY
Yes.

INGRID
Oh, that's unfair.

BARNABY
Ninety-four percent.

She sits down on a wheel of cheese, still chewing, and writes a single line on the clipboard.

INGRID
"Approved with reservations."

BARNABY
What reservations?

INGRID
That I get another piece.
